# Fahrenheit Mod Manager

A GUI to perform basic manipulation of Fahrenheit mods: 
- enabling/disabling
- reordering loadorder
- importing/exporting mod packs
- importing loose EFL file trees
- launching Final Fantasy `X`, `X-2`, `X-2 Last Mission` through Fahrenheit with optional arguments

This is a work in progress. The program stub, which is a basic Win32/D3D11 ImGui desktop application,
is available for inspection with a limited user interface.